messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nSome basketball players are not American. All basketball players are tall. If someone is tall, they wear large shoes. If someone wears large shoes, they wear large-sized clothes. Yuri does not wear large-size clothes.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? If Yuri does not wear large shoes, then Yuri is an American basketball player.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', "<think>\n.\nOkay, so I have this logical reasoning problem to solve.Let me try to break it down step by step.The context gives me several statements, and I need to figure out whether the given statement is true, false, or uncertain based on that context.\n\nFirst, let me list out the given information:.\n\n1.Some basketball players are not American.So, that means there exists at least one basketball player who is not American.But it doesn't say all or most, just some.\n\n2.All basketball players are tall.So, if someone is a basketball player, they must be tall.\n\n3.If someone is tall, they wear large shoes.So, tall people wear large shoes.That's a conditional statement: tall → large shoes.\n\n4.If someone wears large shoes, they wear large-sized clothes.So, large shoes → large clothes.\nIf Yuri wears large shoes, then Yuri is not an American basketball player.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
