messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nAll mammals are animals. All monkeys are mammals. An animal is either a monkey or a bird. All birds fly. All animals breathe. If something can fly, then it has wings. If Rock is neither a fly nor a bird, then Rock neither flies nor breathes.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Rock is a monkey.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Uncertain', '<think>\n.\nOkay, so I have this logical reasoning problem to solve.Let me try to break it down step by step.The context gives several statements, and I need to figure out whether the statement "Rock is a monkey" is true, false, or uncertain based on that context.\n\nFirst, let me list out all the given premises to make it clearer:.\n\n1.All mammals are animals.\n2.All monkeys are mammals.\n3.An animal is either a monkey or a bird.\n4.All birds fly.The statement is that Rock is not a monkey.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
