nt is false because he did not visit a mountain range in New Mexico. However, it is worth double-checking to ensure nothing was overlooked. The context mentions the Picuris Mountains being in New Mexico or Texas, but the absence of a donated mine eliminates Texas. Therefore, the Picuris Mountains are not in New Mexico, and Juan did not visit them, making the statement unquestionably false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
