e, and possibly others.But the context doesn\'t specify how many people were on the leaderboard in total.It only mentions the six-way tie and that Descampe is on the leaderboard.\n\nTherefore, the statement is certain because we have enough information to confirm that Descampe was in the tie.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
